  "job_B3.4.19_20251003_114734": {
    "text": "Gode & his sylfes synna geece\u00fe.\n& us is eac mycel ned\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we ge\u00feencean hu Drihten us mid his \u00ferowunga alesde from deofles\nFor\u00feon we sceolan weor\u00f0ian \u00fe\u00e6t halige sigetacen Cristes rode & \u00e6fterfylgeon & biddon ure synna\nAc hw\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m men sy mare \u00feearf to \u00feencenne \u00feonne embe his sauwle \u00feearfe, & hwonne se d\u00e6g\nSweotollice we magon ongeotan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea syndon heowcu\u00f0e \u00fee we geseon ne magon.\nSwa eac monegum men genihtsuma\u00f0 \u00feisse worlde gestreon \u00e6t his ende, \u00feeah hw\u00e6\u00feere he sceal winnan\n\u00deonne is ungelic be \u00feon ecan life, \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6g begeotan \u00e6lc man \u00feara \u00fee her wile mid godum willan\nUs is \u00feonne ned\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we secan \u00feone l\u00e6cedom ure sauwle; for\u00feon \u00fee Drihten is swi\u00f0e mildheort se\nFor\u00f0on we sceolan mid ealle mod & m\u00e6gene to Gode gecyrran & don so\u00f0e bote ure yfeld\u00e6da, \u00feonne\nEa\u00femodgia\u00fe eow sylfe under \u00fe\u00e6re mihte Godes handa, \u00feonne genyre\u00fe he eow of eallum deofles\nMen \u00fea leofostan, ge\u00feencea\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t ge gelomlice winna\u00f0, & a embe \u00fe\u00e6t sorgia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we urne lichoman\nFor\u00feon us is myccle mare ned\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we winnon ymbe ure saule \u00feearfe, seo bi\u00fe ge ondweard on\nIc eow halsige, cw\u00e6\u00fe Agustinus, \u00fe\u00e6t ge gongan to byrgenne weligra manna, \u00feonne magon ge geseon\nHie w\u00e6ron welige on \u00feyssum middangearde, & heora wlenca w\u00e6ron swi\u00fee monigfealde on landum &\nBehealda\u00f0 nu georne eall \u00fe\u00e6t is from heora eagum gewiten.\nHie h\u00e6fdon manige glengas deorwyr\u00fera hr\u00e6gla.\nEac swylce hie h\u00e6fdon wif & cyfesa, & heora fyrenlustas, & wiste, & plegan, & oforgedrync, & dyslice\nAc hwyder gewiton \u00fea welan, & \u00fea glengas, & \u00fea idlan blissa?\nO\u00fe\u00fee hwyder gewiton \u00fea mycclan weorod \u00fee him ymb ferdon & stodan?\n& hw\u00e6r syndon \u00fea \u00fee hie heredan, & him olyhtword sprecan?\n& hw\u00e6r com seo fr\u00e6twodnes heora husa & seo gesomnung \u00feara deorwyr\u00fera gimma, o\u00fe\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t unm\u00e6te\nO\u00fe\u00fee hw\u00e6r com heora snyttro & seo or\u00feonce glaunes, & se \u00fee \u00fea gebregdnan domas demde?\n& seo wlitignes heora r\u00e6sta & setla, o\u00fe\u00fee seo manigfealde licetung heora freonda, & seo myccle\nEalle \u00fea syndon nu from heora eagum gewitene, & ofor \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6fre efngemyndige hider eft ne cuma\u00fe, ah\nFor\u00f0on, men \u00f0a leofestan, don we so\u00fee hreowe & bote ure synna, \u00fea hwile \u00fee we on \u00feyssum life syn;\nNe \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6s nan mon wenan \u00fe\u00e6t hine o\u00feer mon m\u00e6ge from ecum witum alesan, gif he sylf nele his\nFor\u00feon we sceolon nu beon gemyndige ure saula \u00feearfe, \u00fea hwile \u00fee we moton, for\u00feon \u00fee \u00e6ghwylc\nSe getreowa man sceal syllan his god on \u00fea tid \u00fee hine sylfne selest lyste his brucan; & \u00fe\u00e6t sceal \u00feonne\nEac we magon ge\u00feencean \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t hefigre is, \u00fe\u00e6t man mid mand\u00e6dum & mid synnum him sylfum\n\u00deonne sceolon we nu gemunan ure nyd\u00feearfe, & geneh ge\u00feencean emb ure saula \u00feearfe \u00fee l\u00e6s ure dea\u00fe\nMen, geearnian we nu \u00fe\u00e6t ure se ytmesta d\u00e6g sy engla gefea, & us seo upplice eadignes onfo.\nGecyrron we nu to Drihtnes willan; for\u00feon he us swy\u00fee mildheortlice for\u00fela\u00feode, & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe,\nHe \u00feonne gecyrde to us, \u00fea he hider becom of his F\u00e6der rice, & hine ungyrede \u00fe\u00e6s godcundan\n\u00dea he geseah \u00fe\u00e6t eal manna cynn on missenlicum gedwolum from heora Scyppende gewitene w\u00e6ron,\n\u00dea gela\u00feode he hie to ecean life, & ealre ea\u00f0modnesse bysene he us on \u00fe\u00e6m manigfealdum wundrum\n& \u00fea m\u00e6stan lufan & mildheortnesse he us gecy\u00f0de, \u00fea he lichomlicne dea\u00fe ge\u00ferowode & eal mancyn\nNis \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne n\u00e6nig man \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feurfe \u00feone deopan grund \u00fe\u00e6s hatan leges & \u00fe\u00e6s heardan leges\nHw\u00e6t we nu gehyrdon of hwylcum hugu d\u00e6le secggan be \u00fe\u00e6m eadmodnessum & mildheortnessum,\nFor\u00feon we sceolan nu beon, \u00fea hwile \u00fee we on \u00feysse worlde wunia\u00fe, Godes beboda swy\u00fee gemyndige\n& on eallum tidum secggan we him \u00feanc ealra his miltsa & his ea\u00f0modnessa & his geofena \u00fee he us\n\u00deonne forgife\u00fe he us \u00fe\u00e6t we motan to widan feore his \u00fea wuldorf\u00e6stan onsyne mid sibbe sceawian,\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t wuldorf\u00e6ste lif \u00fe\u00e6tte englas, & heahenglas, & heahf\u00e6deras, & witgan & ealle halige on\n\u00de\u00e6r bi\u00fe a ece gefea buton unrotnesse, & geogo\u00fe buton yldo.\nNe bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6r sar ne gewinn, ne n\u00e6nig une\u00fenes, ne sorg ne wop, ne hungor, ne \u00feurst, ne ece yfel.\nNe \u00fe\u00e6r mon his feond finde\u00f0, ne his freond forl\u00e6te\u00fe.\nAc \u00fe\u00e6r wunian mot se \u00fea stowe gesece\u00fe, mid engla sibbe on ecean wuldre for urum Drihtne se leofa\u00f0",
